# promise: #743
# Resting the pointer on a closed folder shows its preview; moving it straight onto the folder right above or
# below shows that folder's preview instead, as on any other folder (GitHub #743, xEsk, 0.1.55: the next
# folder's preview didn't come, only one two rows away did). The pointer is a real one, moved through the
# window server (scripts/hid-click/click.m).
requires screen
env CRA_TEST_BACKGROUND=0
budget rss=600 stalls50=10
pace 0.5
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false}
